{"title":"Career Roadmap · Pharmacovigilance Associate","role":"Pharmacovigilance Associate","summary":"A Pharmacovigilance (PV) Associate supports the collection, processing, coding, quality review, documentation, and reporting of drug-safety information.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Pharm (Bachelor of Pharmacy)","Course":"Pharma Data / Pharmacovigilance & Regulatory (Skill-integrated)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Pharmacovigilance (PV) Associate supports the collection, processing, coding, quality review, documentation, and reporting of drug-safety information."},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular specialization, the strongest positioning is the combination of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pharmacy","Pharmacovigilance","Regulatory knowledge","Data analytics."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adverse event intake"},{"text":"Individual Case Safety Report (ICSR) processing"},{"text":"Case validation"},{"text":"Duplicate checking"},{"text":"MedDRA coding"},{"text":"Case narrative preparation"},{"text":"Seriousness assessment"},{"text":"Follow-up activities"},{"text":"Literature surveillance"},{"text":"Safety database management"},{"text":"Quality checks"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting support"},{"text":"Safety-data reconciliation"},{"text":"Basic safety analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The data component provides an additional advantage because modern PV operations increasingly depend on structured safety data, dashboards, automation, and analytics."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Pharm + PV Preparation"},{"text":"Pharmacology, clinical research, PV, regulatory affairs, data analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"PV Associate → Senior PV Associate"},{"text":"ICSR processing, MedDRA, safety databases, QC, literature"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"PV Specialist / Safety Data Specialist"},{"text":"Signal detection, aggregate reporting, analytics, safety systems"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Safety Scientist / PV Manager"},{"text":"Safety strategy, risk management, governance, global PV operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Pharm","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Pharmacy Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Anatomy"},{"text":"Physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical chemistry"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Basic pharmacology"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical calculations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Drug","Pharmacological Action","Therapeutic Effect","Possible Adverse Effect","Patient Safety Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Pharmacology + Clinical Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Build deeper knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmacokinetics"},{"text":"Pharmacodynamics"},{"text":"Receptors"},{"text":"Dose-response relationships"},{"text":"Drug toxicity"},{"text":"Drug interactions"},{"text":"Contraindications"},{"text":"Therapeutic index"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic areas"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiovascular"},{"text":"CNS"},{"text":"Anti-infective"},{"text":"Oncology"},{"text":"Diabetes"},{"text":"Respiratory"},{"text":"Gastrointestinal"},{"text":"Immunology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical trial phases"},{"text":"Protocols"},{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Investigator responsibilities"},{"text":"Clinical trial documentation"},{"text":"Safety reporting"},{"text":"Serious adverse events"},{"text":"Good Clinical Practice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Pharmacovigilance Core"},{"type":"p","text":"This should be the primary specialization stage."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete ICSR workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Safety Information Received","Case Intake","Case Validation","Duplicate Check","Case Triage","Data Entry","Medical Coding","Seriousness / Expectedness","Narrative","Medical Review","Quality Control","Regulatory Reporting","Archiving"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Regulatory + Data Integration"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine PV with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drug-safety regulations"},{"text":"Safety reporting concepts"},{"text":"Regulatory timelines"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Product information"},{"text":"Reference safety information"},{"text":"Aggregate safety reporting"},{"text":"Regulatory documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Trend analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This combination is the key differentiator for ID 2020."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Pharmacovigilance Knowledge"}]},{"heading":"ICSR Processing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Valid case criteria"},{"text":"Case intake"},{"text":"Triage"},{"text":"Seriousness"},{"text":"Expectedness"},{"text":"Causality"},{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Reporter information"},{"text":"Suspect drug"},{"text":"Concomitant drugs"},{"text":"Medical history"},{"text":"Adverse events"},{"text":"Outcomes"},{"text":"Follow-up"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A PV Associate should be able to move accurately from unstructured safety information → structured case data."}]},{"heading":"MedDRA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"System Organ Class"},{"text":"High Level Group Term"},{"text":"High Level Term"},{"text":"Preferred Term"},{"text":"Lowest Level Term"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient's Description","Clinical Interpretation","Medical Concept","MedDRA Preferred Term"]},{"type":"p","text":"MedDRA proficiency is one of the most practical skills for entry-level PV operations."}]},{"heading":"Seriousness vs Severity","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a common interview topic."},{"type":"h","text":"Severity"},{"type":"p","text":"Describes the intensity of an event."},{"type":"h","text":"Seriousness"},{"type":"p","text":"Determines whether an event meets defined seriousness criteria."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore:"},{"type":"p","text":"A severe event is not automatically a serious event."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand seriousness concepts involving outcomes such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Death"},{"text":"Life-threatening circumstances"},{"text":"Hospitalization"},{"text":"Significant disability"},{"text":"Congenital anomaly"},{"text":"Other medically important conditions"}]}]},{"heading":"Causality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand factors used when assessing whether a drug may have contributed to an event:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temporal relationship"},{"text":"Dechallenge"},{"text":"Rechallenge"},{"text":"Alternative causes"},{"text":"Biological plausibility"},{"text":"Existing safety information"},{"text":"Patient history"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A PV Associate may support the process, while medical/regulatory judgments depend on role and organizational responsibilities."}]},{"heading":"Expectedness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand whether an event is consistent with established product safety information."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the role of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product information"},{"text":"Reference safety information"},{"text":"Investigator's brochure"},{"text":"Core safety information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Affairs Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Because this specialization explicitly includes regulatory knowledge, learn how PV interacts with regulatory processes."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Discovery","Preclinical","Clinical Trials","Regulatory Submission","Approval","Commercialization","Post-Marketing Safety Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"PV continues throughout the product lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Aggregate Safety Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Periodic safety reporting"},{"text":"Aggregate safety assessment"},{"text":"Benefit-risk evaluation"},{"text":"Risk management plans"},{"text":"Signal evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"At entry level, understanding the purpose and structure is more important than claiming expert-level reporting experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Pharma Data Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel — Essential"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"COUNTIF/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"SUMIF/SUMIFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case tracking"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Quality checks"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Data cleaning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"FROM"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"Then progress to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Data-quality checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example use cases:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retrieve cases by drug"},{"text":"Analyze events by month"},{"text":"Compare serious/non-serious cases"},{"text":"Identify missing data"},{"text":"Detect potential duplicates"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cases by month"},{"text":"Cases by therapeutic area"},{"text":"Serious vs non-serious"},{"text":"Cases by reporter type"},{"text":"Event distribution"},{"text":"Case-processing timelines"},{"text":"Follow-up status"},{"text":"Quality metrics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"PV Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Total Cases"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Serious Cases"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Case Trends"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Therapeutic Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Adverse Events"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Processing Timelines"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Quality Metrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Python is optional for basic PV operations but highly valuable for a pharma-data career path."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"basic statistics"},{"text":"data cleaning"},{"text":"regular expressions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety-data cleaning"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Text processing"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Literature screening support"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"A PV Associate should develop a strong data-quality mindset."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing fields"},{"text":"Invalid dates"},{"text":"Duplicate cases"},{"text":"Inconsistent drug names"},{"text":"Incorrect coding"},{"text":"Conflicting patient information"},{"text":"Invalid values"},{"text":"Data-entry errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Think:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Safety Data","Validation","Cleaning","Standardization","Analysis","Decision Support"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"This specialization is particularly well suited to AI-assisted PV."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automatic case intake"},{"text":"NLP-based adverse-event extraction"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Medical coding suggestions"},{"text":"Literature screening"},{"text":"Case prioritization"},{"text":"Narrative drafting assistance"},{"text":"Data-quality checks"},{"text":"Signal detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future PV Associate should understand both:"},{"type":"p","text":"Domain knowledge + AI limitations."},{"type":"p","text":"AI outputs should be appropriately validated and reviewed in regulated workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Synthetic ICSR Processing System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case ID"},{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Suspect drug"},{"text":"Adverse event"},{"text":"Event date"},{"text":"Outcome"},{"text":"Seriousness"},{"text":"Concomitant medication"},{"text":"Reporter"},{"text":"Follow-up status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then build a complete simulated processing workflow."},{"type":"p","text":"Label all data clearly as synthetic/training data."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — PV Power BI Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Total cases"},{"text":"Monthly case trend"},{"text":"Serious cases"},{"text":"Cases by therapeutic class"},{"text":"Adverse-event categories"},{"text":"Case-processing status"},{"text":"Follow-up cases"},{"text":"Aging analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — SQL Safety Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Create tables such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"Patients"},{"type":"p","text":"Drugs"},{"type":"p","text":"Cases"},{"type":"p","text":"Adverse_Events"},{"type":"p","text":"Reporters"},{"type":"p","text":"Followups"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Missing-data queries"},{"text":"Trend analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — MedDRA Coding Exercise"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 50–100 fictional clinical descriptions and demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reported Term","Clinical Concept","Standardized Term","MedDRA Coding"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to demonstrate understanding of standardized medical terminology, not to claim production-level coding authorization."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Automated PV Data-Quality Checker"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing case IDs"},{"text":"Duplicate case IDs"},{"text":"Invalid dates"},{"text":"Missing suspect drugs"},{"text":"Missing adverse events"},{"text":"Inconsistent values"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is an excellent project for differentiating a data-oriented PV candidate."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Literature Surveillance"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated literature-monitoring workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Scientific Literature","Search","Screening","Relevance Assessment","Potential Safety Information","Case Identification","Documentation"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PV Associate Intern"},{"text":"Drug Safety Intern"},{"text":"ICSR Processing Intern"},{"text":"Safety Operations Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Research Intern"},{"text":"Clinical Data Intern"},{"text":"Clinical Safety Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Operations Intern"},{"text":"Drug Safety Regulatory Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Life Sciences Data Analyst"},{"text":"Clinical Data Management Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Internship Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Pharm Year 2","Clinical Research Exposure","B.Pharm Year 3","PV / Drug Safety Internship","Final Year","PV + Data Analytics Project","PV Associate / Drug Safety Associate"]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"With this skill-integrated specialization, potential entry roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmacovigilance Associate"},{"text":"Drug Safety Associate"},{"text":"PV Executive"},{"text":"Safety Data Associate"},{"text":"ICSR Processing Associate"},{"text":"Clinical Data Associate"},{"text":"Clinical Research Associate — where eligible"},{"text":"Regulatory Operations Associate"},{"text":"Medical Information Associate"},{"text":"Safety Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Drug Safety Operations Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"B.Pharm"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"ICSR processing"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"MedDRA"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Clinical research"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Regulatory fundamentals"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Safety database exposure"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Literature surveillance"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"AI/NLP"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"★★★★★"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize practical learning in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"text":"ICSR processing"},{"text":"MedDRA"},{"text":"Clinical research"},{"text":"GCP"},{"text":"Regulatory affairs"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not the person with the most certificates; it is the person who can process safety data accurately and explain what the data means."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not required for every PV Associate position."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Pharm"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Pharmacy Practice"},{"text":"Clinical Pharmacy"},{"text":"Regulatory Affairs"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical Quality Assurance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.Sc."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Life Sciences"},{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Toxicology"},{"text":"Epidemiology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for later progression into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmaceutical management"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Healthcare management"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Analytics Education"},{"type":"p","text":"A formal master's is not always necessary, but advanced study in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Biostatistics"},{"text":"Health informatics"},{"text":"Clinical data science"}]},{"type":"p","text":"can strengthen the PV + Data pathway."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. ICSR Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case processing"},{"text":"MedDRA"},{"text":"Narratives"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Quality control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Safety Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine PV with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety trends"},{"text":"Case metrics"},{"text":"Quality analytics"},{"text":"Signal-support analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Signal Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Signal identification"},{"text":"Signal evaluation"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Benefit-risk assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Clinical Trial Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical trial adverse events"},{"text":"Serious adverse events"},{"text":"Safety reconciliation"},{"text":"Sponsor/CRO safety operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Regulatory PV"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PV"},{"text":"Regulatory affairs"},{"text":"Safety reporting"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI-Enabled Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PV"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most future-oriented paths for this specialization."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Pharm","PV Intern / Drug Safety Intern","PV Associate","Senior PV Associate","PV Specialist","Senior PV Specialist","PV Manager","Senior PV Manager","PV Director / Head of Pharmacovigilance"]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-oriented pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["PV Associate","Safety Data Analyst","Senior Safety Data Analyst","PV Analytics Specialist","Safety Analytics Lead","Digital PV / Safety Data Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["PV Associate","Safety Specialist","Safety Scientist","Senior Safety Scientist","Safety Lead","Safety Science Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"Natural Language Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"NLP can assist in extracting structured information from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient narratives"},{"text":"Clinical notes"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Spontaneous reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Unstructured Text","NLP Extraction","Drug / Event / Patient Data","Standardization","Human Review","PV Database"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Case Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential future workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Safety Report","AI-assisted Extraction","Potential Case Fields","Validation","Human Review","Coding","Quality Control"]},{"type":"p","text":"The critical skill is understanding where automation is appropriate and where human/regulatory review is required."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Pharm"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"ICSR Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MedDRA"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory Affairs"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Medical Terminology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Safety Databases"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"NLP / AI Awarenes